  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "I found TX-0401 in your account ACC-1005 (EUR):\n\n- **Amount:** EUR 240.00 (verified)\n- **Merchant:** TechMart Online\n- **Date:** 2026-07-20\n- **Type:** Card payment, outgoing, status settled\n\nYour records also show **TX-0402**, another EUR 240.00 payment to TechMart Online on 2026-07-14, also settled. Two identical payments to the same merchant within a few days may be relevant to your situation.\n\nThese reason codes could apply, depending on what happened:\n\n1. **duplicate_charge**: you were charged more than once for the same purchase. TX-0401 and TX-0402 would fit this.\n2. **unauthorized_debit**: you did not authorize this payment.\n3. **fraud_card_not_present**: an online card payment was made using your card details without your involvement.\n4. **goods_not_received**: you paid for something that was never delivered.\n5. **service_not_rendered**: you paid for a service that was not provided.\n\nTell me which of these matches what happened, and I will check whether TX-0401 is eligible for a dispute under that code before anything is filed. I will not open a dispute without your confirmation.",
